---
// src/pages/cara-belanja.astro
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
    title="Panduan Cara Belanja - Yasui Game"
    description="Panduan langkah demi langkah berbelanja akun dan voucher game di Yasui Game secara aman, cepat, dan otomatis."
>
    <main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 pt-4 md:pt-6 pb-20">
        <header class="text-center mb-12">
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-[#00E5FF]/10 border border-[#00E5FF]/30 text-[#00E5FF] text-xs font-mono mb-3">
                <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#00E5FF]"></span>
                DOKUMENTASI OPERASIONAL
            </span>
            <h1
                class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight uppercase mb-3"
                data-i18n="guide.title"
            >
                Cara Order & Checkout
            </h1>
            <p
                class="text-[#94A3B8] font-mono text-xs md:text-sm max-w-lg mx-auto leading-relaxed"
                data-i18n="guide.subtitle"
            >
                Panduan lengkap berbelanja akun game di Yasui Game.
                Aman, terverifikasi, dan otomatis 24/7.
            </p>
        </header>

        <section class="space-y-4">
            <article class="bg-[#11131A] border border-[#222634] hover:border-[#33394D] rounded-lg p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6 items-start transition-colors">
                <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-14 h-14 bg-[#0D0F15] border border-[#222634] rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center font-mono font-bold text-xl text-[#00E5FF]">
                    01
                </div>

                <div class="flex-1">
                    <h2
                        class="text-base font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider mb-2 font-mono"
                        data-i18n="guide.step1"
                    >
                        Pilih Item & Spesifikasi Akun
                    </h2>
                    <p
                        class="text-[#94A3B8] text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4"
                        data-i18n="guide.step1_desc"
                    >
                        Jelajahi katalog game favorit Anda (Summoners War, Roblox, MLBB, dll). Pilih akun atau tier yang sesuai dengan spesifikasi dan budget. Seluruh listing telah melalui verifikasi spesifikasi manual dan otomatis.
                    </p>
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-[10px] font-mono text-[#94A3B8] uppercase">
                        <span class="bg-[#0D0F15] px-2.5 py-1 border border-[#222634] rounded">Katalog Terverifikasi</span>
                        <span class="bg-[#0D0F15] px-2.5 py-1 border border-[#222634] rounded">Filter Tier & Server</span>
                        <span class="bg-[#0D0F15] px-2.5 py-1 border border-[#222634] rounded">Stok Real-Time</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </article>

            <article class="bg-[#11131A] border border-[#222634] hover:border-[#33394D] rounded-lg p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6 items-start transition-colors">
                <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-14 h-14 bg-[#0D0F15] border border-[#222634] rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center font-mono font-bold text-xl text-[#00E5FF]">
                    02
                </div>

                <div class="flex-1">
                    <h2
                        class="text-base font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider mb-2 font-mono"
                        data-i18n="guide.step2"
                    >
                        Lengkapi Data Kontak Pemesan
                    </h2>
                    <p
                        class="text-[#94A3B8] text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4"
                        data-i18n="guide.step2_desc"
                    >
                        Pada form checkout, masukkan <b class="text-[#F8FAFC]">Email & Nomor WhatsApp aktif</b>. Data ini digunakan untuk pengiriman faktur, instruksi pembayaran, dan kredensial akun game yang Anda beli.
                    </p>
                    <div
                        class="p-3 bg-[#0D0F15] border-l-2 border-amber-500 border-y border-r border-[#222634] rounded-r-lg text-xs text-amber-300 font-mono"
                        data-i18n="guide.important_typo"
                    >
                        <span class="font-bold">PERHATIAN:</span> Pastikan email tidak salah ketik (typo) agar link invoice dan notifikasi terkirim tepat sasaran.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </article>

            <article class="bg-[#11131A] border border-[#222634] hover:border-[#33394D] rounded-lg p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6 items-start transition-colors">
                <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-14 h-14 bg-[#0D0F15] border border-[#222634] rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center font-mono font-bold text-xl text-[#00E5FF]">
                    03
                </div>

                <div class="flex-1">
                    <h2
                        class="text-base font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider mb-2 font-mono"
                        data-i18n="guide.step3"
                    >
                        Pilih Metode Pembayaran & Lunasi
                    </h2>
                    <p
                        class="text-[#94A3B8] text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4"
                        data-i18n="guide.step3_desc"
                    >
                        Pilih kanal bayar yang didukung oleh Payment Gateway resmi Duitku. Pembayaran diproses dengan verifikasi otomatis tanpa perlu upload bukti transfer manual:
                    </p>
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-2.5">
                        <div
                            class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-mono text-[#F8FAFC] bg-[#0D0F15] p-2.5 rounded border border-[#222634]"
                            data-i18n="guide.payment_qris"
                        >
                            <div class="i-lucide-qr-code text-[#00E5FF]"></div>
                            <span>QRIS Real-Time</span>
                        </div>
                        <div
                            class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-mono text-[#F8FAFC] bg-[#0D0F15] p-2.5 rounded border border-[#222634]"
                            data-i18n="guide.payment_card"
                        >
                            <div class="i-lucide-credit-card text-[#00E5FF]"></div>
                            <span>Virtual Account (VA)</span>
                        </div>
                        <div
                            class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-mono text-[#F8FAFC] bg-[#0D0F15] p-2.5 rounded border border-[#222634]"
                            data-i18n="guide.payment_crypto"
                        >
                            <div class="i-lucide-wallet text-[#00E5FF]"></div>
                            <span>E-Wallet & Retail</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </article>

            <article class="bg-[#11131A] border border-[#222634] hover:border-[#33394D] rounded-lg p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6 items-start transition-colors">
                <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-14 h-14 bg-[#0D0F15] border border-emerald-500/40 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center font-mono font-bold text-xl text-emerald-400">
                    04
                </div>

                <div class="flex-1">
                    <h2
                        class="text-base font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider mb-2 font-mono"
                        data-i18n="guide.step4"
                    >
                        Terima Kredensial & Amankan Akun
                    </h2>
                    <p
                        class="text-[#94A3B8] text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4"
                        data-i18n="guide.step4_desc"
                    >
                        Setelah pembayaran terverifikasi otomatis, pesanan langsung diproses. Kredensial akun dikirim via Email, WhatsApp, dan dapat diakses langsung di Dashboard Pesanan dalam waktu 1 - 5 menit.
                    </p>
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 text-xs font-mono">
                        <div
                            class="flex items-center gap-2 text-emerald-400 uppercase font-bold"
                            data-i18n="guide.instant_delivery"
                        >
                            <div class="i-lucide-zap w-4 h-4"></div>
                            <span>Pengiriman Otomatis 24/7</span>
                        </div>
                        <div
                            class="flex items-center gap-2 text-emerald-400 uppercase font-bold"
                            data-i18n="guide.warranty"
                        >
                            <div class="i-lucide-shield-check w-4 h-4"></div>
                            <span>Garansi Toko Resmi</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </article>
        </section>

        <section class="mt-12 text-center border-t border-[#222634] pt-8">
            <h3 class="text-white font-bold mb-3 text-sm font-mono uppercase" data-i18n="guide.need_help">
                Butuh Bantuan atau Panduan Khusus?
            </h3>
            <a
                href="https://wa.me/6285972775966"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                class="yg-btn-secondary inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs"
            >
                <div class="i-lucide-message-circle text-emerald-400"></div>
                <span data-i18n="guide.contact_admin">Hubungi CS WhatsApp Yasui Game</span>
            </a>
            <p
                class="text-[10px] text-[#64748B] mt-3 font-mono"
                data-i18n="guide.cs_hours"
            >
                Operasional Setiap Hari: 09:00 - 23:00 WIB
            </p>
        </section>
    </main>
</Layout>
